    "Existing-pin impact review: test_commitOnPoolMidEdit (gradual scroll) still yields exactly one commit (edited-flag idempotency across onPooled + onFrameIndexChanged); test_rejectedCommitSurvivesRecycle paths (pooled or destroyed) both reject once and keep the binding alive; test_loaderGate has no in-flight edits; bare-cell tests leave edited=false at teardown so the new destruction-commit does not fire spuriously."
