    "onFrameIndexChanged flush runs in addition to onPooled on the pooled path — harmless (edited-flag guard) but worth knowing."
  ],
  "noStagedFiles": true,
  "diffSummary": "Added PosesTable root suppressDestructionCommit + PosesDialog.prepareDiscard(); added 6 QML test pins (keyboard contract, destruction commit/suppression, instant-jump flush); corrected the stale commit-on-pool comment.",
  "reviewFindings": [
    "no blockers — all edits syntax-verified; runtime verification (harness run) is the orchestrator's, per constraints"
  ],
  "manualNotes": "Agent B (main.qml wiring) owns: calling poseDialog.prepareDiscard() before close() on the discard-Yes path, plus the discard-dialog Escape-loop fix. The PosesTable root property I added is REQUIRED for the landed delegate design to load at all."
}
